body:
Quick pass: good. Head `6189d81` merges cleanly with `main`. On this head, the quick gate is green (394 steps, 0 failed, with `example_catalog` inside its budget), and clippy of `camcraft-app` and `camcraft-ui` is clean. The `crates/ui` test count goes from 2019 to 2021.

Independent pre-reviews of `2d0bf9e` and `6189d81` found no blocking points. They confirm three things:
- the copy carries the full tool record (definition, holder body, stick-out, drawn cutter, component stack) unchanged, except the new number;
- each refusal comes before the history;
- Duplicate is now disabled while the main form draft has unapplied changes.

Known limit, filed: the holder, body and stack drafts of the editor are not part of that guard yet (#4506). I flag the PR ready for review.

@sn3ro, a UI/UX review from you is welcome on this PR (Duplicate in the tool editor footer). A contributor's pre-check comment is fine; it is not a condition for the merge.
